26 0 obj
<</Title(Core Palette)/Dest[24 0 R/Fit]/Count -2/Parent 25 0 R/First 27 0 R/Last 28 0 R>>
endobj

27 0 obj
<</Title(The Modern Rustic palette is built on earthy neutrals, warm undertones, and natural contrast. It draws from organic materials\204aged wood, stone, clay, and linen\204to create harmony between modern simplicity and rustic depth. The tones should feel soft and lived-in, never stark or synthetic.)/Dest[24 0 R/Fit]/Parent 26 0 R/Next 28 0 R>>
endobj

28 0 obj
<</Title(These colors should feel timeless, touchable, and softly desaturated\204never overly crisp or saturated. They evoke nature: sun-bleached stone, aged timber, linen fibers, and cool slate. Use warm tones for base elements \(walls, flooring, large furniture\) and the darker or cooler hues for depth and contrast through accents, metalwork, and textiles.)/Dest[24 0 R/Fit]/Parent 26 0 R/Prev 27 0 R>>
endobj

