35 0 obj
<</Title(Each of these colors were carefully selected from trusted brands like Sherwin-Williams and Benjamin Moore to reflect the palette\220s organic balance of warmth and restraint. Use the lighter neutrals to create an airy foundation, and introduce deeper or accent tones through cabinetry, trim, or d\351cor to add richness and contrast while keeping the space serene and cohesive. As always, be sure to sample these in your space as light and material cam shift how they appear.)/Dest[32 0 R/Fit]/Parent 34 0 R>>
endobj

