43 0 obj
<</Title(Finishes, textures, and patterns should feel intentional, tactile, and understated. Metals are best when matte or softly patinated, offering structure and contrast without shine, while natural textures like wood, stone, linen, and leather bring warmth and authenticity. Simple, timeworn patterns\204woven, striped, or subtly checked\204add visual interest without overwhelming the space. Together, these elements create depth through restraint, allowing craftsmanship and materiality to take center stage while maintaining a calm, grounded aesthetic.)/Dest[41 0 R/Fit]/Parent 42 0 R/Next 44 0 R>>
endobj

